                "key": 1792368000101,
                "children": [],
                "todo": {
                  "content": "admin/background.php:8-105 — Administrative AJAX handlers run without an authorization check; require an authenticated admin for every management action while explicitly allowing only the student quiz operations that must remain public.",
                  "id": 1792368000101,
                  "level": "danger",
                  "done": false,
                  "start": 1792368000101
                }
              },
              {
                "key": 1792368000102,
                "children": [],
                "todo": {
                  "content": "admin/common.php:523-558 — The admin session is represented by a fixed plaintext cookie with no secure cookie attributes; replace it with a validated session token and set HttpOnly, SameSite, and HTTPS-conditional Secure attributes.",
                  "id": 1792368000102,
                  "level": "danger",
                  "done": false,
                  "start": 1792368000102
                }
              },
              {
                "key": 1792368000103,
                "children": [],
                "todo": {
                  "content": "admin/background.php:193-207 — Module deletion accepts `.` and `..` as valid names and builds a recursive-delete path from the input; validate a single module-directory name and resolve/check its canonical path remains inside the modules root before deleting.",
                  "id": 1792368000103,
                  "level": "danger",
                  "done": true,
                  "start": 1792368000103,
                  "focus": false,
                  "end": 1792504800000
                }
              },
              {
                "key": 1792368000104,
                "children": [],
                "todo": {
                  "content": "admin/background.php:113-146 — Statistics date parameters are interpolated into a shell command without format validation; parse strict calendar dates and filter the log in PHP or pass validated values without shell interpolation.",
                  "id": 1792368000104,
                  "level": "danger",
                  "done": true,
                  "start": 1792368000104,
                  "focus": false,
                  "end": 1792504800000
                }
              },
              {
                "key": 1792368000105,
                "children": [],
                "todo": {
                  "content": "admin/background.php:786-837 — Public quiz listing/detail responses serialize full database rows, including quiz passwords and correct answers; return an explicit student-safe field allowlist and keep grading keys and credentials in authenticated admin responses only.",
                  "id": 1792368000105,
                  "level": "danger",
                  "done": true,
                  "start": 1792368000105,
                  "focus": false,
                  "end": 1792504800000
                }
              },
              {
                "key": 1792368000106,
                "children": [],
                "todo": {
                  "content": "admin/background.php:1153-1197 — Quiz submissions accept arbitrary student/file metadata and persist uploads without size, content-type, or upload-result checks; validate schema, enforce upload limits and allowed file types, generate server-side names, and fail the transaction when a file cannot be safely stored.",
                  "id": 1792368000106,
                  "level": "danger",
                  "done": false,
                  "start": 1792368000106
                }
              },
              {
                "key": 1792368000107,
                "children": [],
                "todo": {
                  "content": "admin/background.php:1011-1045 — Grade updates accept arbitrary answer IDs and scores without checking that answers belong to the selected submission or that points are within each question's range; scope updates through the submission and enforce server-side score bounds.",
                  "id": 1792368000107,
                  "level": "warning",
                  "done": false,
                  "start": 1792368000107
                }
              },
              {
                "key": 1792368000108,
                "children": [],
                "todo": {
                  "content": "admin/storage.php:284-346 — Quiz-media upload validation checks only the filename extension; verify the actual content, impose size limits, create collision-resistant server-side names, and reject executable or mismatched file types.",
                  "id": 1792368000108,
                  "level": "warning",
                  "done": true,
                  "start": 1792368000108,
                  "focus": false,
                  "end": 1792504800000
                }
              },
              {
                "key": 1792368000109,
                "children": [],
                "todo": {
                  "content": "admin/storage.php:193-223,745-770 — ZIP extraction trusts archive paths and does not verify extraction containment or resource limits; inspect entries before extraction, reject traversal and link entries, and cap expanded size/file count.",
                  "id": 1792368000109,
                  "level": "warning",
                  "done": true,
                  "start": 1792368000109,
                  "focus": false,
                  "end": 1792504800000
