                "children": [],
                "todo": {
                  "content": "admin/common.php:189-195 — The SQLite database is chmodded to `0666` on every connection; create it with a restrictive mode and apply only the device-specific group permissions needed for web and CLI access.",
                  "id": 1792368000111,
